{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14103190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317201:":{"text":"女王陛下、これらの石材に魔法の――","source_cn":"女王在上，赐予这些粗糙的石材——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9655D96E9271F7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317202:":{"text":"また女王陛下かよ。毎日毎日よく飽きないな！","source_cn":"又来了！整天把女王挂嘴边","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BE41F49740502B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317203:":{"text":"ふん、私たちがいなければ――","source_cn":"哼，没有我们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x336D269101E7B812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317204:":{"text":"ん？あそこにいるのは、ゾーヤおばさんじゃないか！","source_cn":"诶？那不是祖娅吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE04667E5DF2FCA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317205:":{"text":"おーい、ゾーヤおばさーん！","source_cn":"祖娅——姑姑——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B1947C9215BCE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410319001:0":{"text":"ゾーヤおばさん！本当にあんたなのか？","source_cn":"祖娅姑姑……真的是祖娅姑姑吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60DA3B3B6C1F320E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410319002:1":{"text":"お、おばさん……？","source_cn":"啊，姑姑……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92B3A6C6AD04AF44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410319003:1":{"text":"本当にゾーヤおばさんだ！ああ、ヘクト様に感謝……自分の目が信じられないよ！","source_cn":"姑姑！真是你！赫托在下……我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1CF05C71DE5D95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410319004:1":{"text":"ひ、人違いだって！","source_cn":"呃……你、你认错人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EC04E1E0212ACAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410319005:1":{"text":"人違いなもんか！俺だよ、俺！子どもの頃、おばさんの酒をこっそり飲んで、大目玉食らったフォンだよ！","source_cn":"怎么会？是我啊！芬恩！小时候我偷喝你的酒，还被你狠狠打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AF4F8E26D9ABFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410319006:1":{"text":"嬉しいなあ、<style=\"highlight\">百年前と全然変わってないね！</style>","source_cn":"赫托啊，<style=highlight>你长得简直和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x658026E8EA7707B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410319007:1":{"text":"今までどこに行ってたの？フリンさんに聞いても教えてくれないし。","source_cn":"这么些年你去哪了？一点消息都没有！弗林什么都不肯说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169C4B8690C4F3AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410319008:1":{"text":"そう言えば、おばさんがいなくなった後に、フリンさんが村長になったんだよ。俺としては――","source_cn":"说起来，你走之后，弗林就当上了村长。要我说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75555A3578929D3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410319009:1":{"text":"何をサボっているんだ、地表人！早く仕事をしないか！","source_cn":"地表人！你还有闲心聊天？快干活！不要偷懒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B34FD2ABD75611","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410319010:1":{"text":"あ？何だって？俺たちはあんたらの下僕じゃないんだぞ！","source_cn":"嘿，你说谁呢？我可不是你们的仆从！放尊重点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FCB0B29D5C9C57C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410319011:1":{"text":"なんだと、お前たちドワーフにオルデナイトを恵んでいるのは、我らが女王陛下だということを忘れたのか！","source_cn":"别忘了，是你们矮人喊着求着想要深岩晶！如果不是女王开恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2CBC82BB40116F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410319012:1":{"text":"私たちの魔法がなければ、お前たちの創造物など、ただの石の塊に過ぎないのだぞ！","source_cn":"没有我们的魔法，你们造的东西不过是堆死石头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3999C927B1FB083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410319013:1":{"text":"はあ！？あんたらとんがり耳が屋根のある家で暮らせてるのは、俺たちドワーフのおかげなんだぞ！","source_cn":"哈？！要不是我们矮人，你们这群尖耳朵怕是连个遮风挡雨的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6A045918ECA32C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410319014:1":{"text":"このアーチも、柱も、全部俺たちの先祖が心血注いで作ったんだ！","source_cn":"瞧瞧这些拱门和立柱，哪一块不是我们祖辈的心血？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D06CA59C41E39F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410319015:1":{"text":"言葉に気を付けろ。地表人のお前たちが、このような神聖な作業に関われるだけでも光栄に思え。","source_cn":"注意你的语气。让你们这些地表种族参与神圣工程，已是莫大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB512C16713134F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410319016:1":{"text":"はっ！神殿の建設ならまだしも、王都の修繕のどこが神聖なんだよ？","source_cn":"得了吧！建神殿才是神圣工程，给你们修王城算什么神圣？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FDECE6E8F31682D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410319017:1":{"text":"霊水を飲んでるからって、自分たちまで神になったと思ってるのか？","source_cn":"怎么，喝几口灵露就把自己当神了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8FAF3F070F67EB2F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"霊水を飲んでるからって、自分たちまで神になったと思ってるのか？","female":"霊水を飲んでるからって、自分たちまで神になったと思ってるのか？","variant_male_record_index":"155478","variant_female_record_index":"155479","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410319018:1":{"text":"黙れ！さっさと石材を運んでこい！","source_cn":"闭嘴！快去准备石材！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5ACB9CEB15938BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410319019:1":{"text":"やだね！これから休憩するんだ！","source_cn":"我偏不——我要休息了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCD38B18BE86D3D9C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"やだね！これから休憩するんだ！","female":"やだね！これから休憩するんだ！","variant_male_record_index":"155481","variant_female_record_index":"155482","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410319020:1":{"text":"そうか、なら永遠に休ませてやる！","source_cn":"你！那你就永远地休息吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8753B8F60618BD17","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そうか、なら永遠に休ませてやる！","female":"そうか、なら永遠に休ませてやる！","variant_male_record_index":"155484","variant_female_record_index":"155485","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410319021:0":{"text":"ちょっと、やめなって――","source_cn":"住手，先别